            "content_html": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">Acceptance criteria</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> The listed features are documented sufficiently on MDN</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD is updated</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Interactive example and data repos are updated if appropriate</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> The content has been reviewed as needed</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">For folks helping with Firefox related documentation</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Set bugs to <code class=\"notranslate\">dev-doc-complete</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Add entry to Firefox release notes for enabled/preview features</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Add/remove entry to Firefox experimental features page for preference/released features</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Related Gecko bugs</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1906301\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1906301</a> - Implement Trusted Types support for <code class=\"notranslate\">document.write()</code>/<code class=\"notranslate\">document.writeln()</code> - 135\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD updated</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Docs</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1905706\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1905706</a> - <code class=\"notranslate\">HTMLScriptElement</code> attributes src/innerText/textContent/text  - 135\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD updated</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Docs</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1931290\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1931290</a> - <code class=\"notranslate\">Window.setInterval()</code>/<code class=\"notranslate\">setTimeout()</code>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD updated</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Docs</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">These ones for 136</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1940049\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1940049</a> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/SVGAnimatedString/baseVal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">SVGAnimatedString.baseVal</code></a>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3408790407\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27836\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836\">mdn/browser-compat-data#27836</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Docs</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1931293\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1931293</a> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/WorkerGlobalScope/importScripts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">WorkerGlobalScope.importScripts()</code></a>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3408790407\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27836\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836\">mdn/browser-compat-data#27836</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Docs</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1940044\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1940044</a> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/ServiceWorkerContainer/register\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">ServiceWorkerContainer.register()</code></a> - TrustedScriptURL\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3408790407\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27836\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836\">mdn/browser-compat-data#27836</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Docs</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note these ones for 137</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1944504\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1944504</a> onmessage and onreadystatechange attributes - not sure what this means. Asking in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1944504#c8\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1944504#c8</a>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> BCD</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Docs</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">These for 138</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1942306\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1942306</a> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Headers/Content-Security-Policy/trusted-types\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Content-Security-Policy: trusted-types</code></a> - support for setting the allowed trusted type policy names\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3408790407\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27836\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836\">mdn/browser-compat-data#27836</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Docs - Already OK</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">These for 144</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1928932\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1928932</a> - CSP enforcement - I THINK see <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1928932#c21\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1928932#c21</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Other</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Check content open issues to see if any pertain to the subject matter. If there are any that can be closed because of the work, do so. If there are any that can be fixed relatively quickly because of the knowledge from completing this issue and you have time, feel free to go ahead and fix them.</li>\n</ul>",
